+HyperCore supports a limited set of functionality for onchain vaults, but additional features should be built permissionlessly by builders on the HyperEVM. See
+here
+for more details.
+Vault owners receive 10% of the total profits. Note that protocol vaults do not have any fees or profit share. Vaults can be managed by an individual trader or automated by a market maker. All strategies come with their own risk, and users should carefully assess the risks and performance history of a vault before depositing.
